{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"油麻地的士撞傷兩名男子\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-YMT-261110-06.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】油麻地有兩名男子被的士撞傷。</p><p>其中一名男子被的士撞倒後，倒卧在的士車前，昏迷不醒，救護員即場替他施救。</p><p>凌晨1時許，一輛的士沿上海街往尖沙咀方向行駛，左轉入北海街時懷疑失控，撞倒兩名南亞裔男子，一名26歲男子一度昏迷，另一名41歲男子受傷，兩人均送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p>警員封閉一段路面，55歲的士司機涉嫌危險駕駛被捕。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.617292+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T23:40:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:54:57.402278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:13.052487+00:00","content_hash":"418b9405db9e8c4c82e51a9cc64b6b551901446391347e68059afa07b2eb290e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.617292+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}